#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:101
#: 227f02969d2749009e094680dcce80a5
msgid "FSM"
msgstr "FSM"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:103
#: 5e83bbb099d641c7967f11075ba93e0c
msgid ""
"Controller FSM on `/fsm_command` is **`std_msgs/Int32`**. Do not send "
"invented strings such as `stand` / `walk`. See [FSM and "
"Topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)."
msgstr ""
"`/fsm_command` 上的控制器 FSM 是 **`std_msgs/Int32`**。不要发送编造的 `stand` / `walk` 字符串。见 [FSM 与话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:105
#: 82866e2a106c43e6b43969776047079f
msgid "Async Interface"
msgstr "异步接口"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:107
#: ab4adc78bf3541cb9de60b51f67cfbed
msgid ""
"from ros2_robot_interface import AsyncRobotInterface\n"
"import asyncio\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    robot = AsyncRobotInterface()\n"
"    await robot.connect()\n"
"    await robot.move_j_async([0.0, -0.5, 0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 0.0])\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())\n"
msgstr ""
"from ros2_robot_interface import AsyncRobotInterface\n"
"import asyncio\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    robot = AsyncRobotInterface()\n"
"    await robot.connect()\n"
"    await robot.move_j_async([0.0, -0.5, 0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 0.0])\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())\n"

